# WITHERLEA: the cellar ending after being caught. The demo player lets him
# catch it once early (the radiogram, then it stands still), wakes in the
# cold store with everything, and plays on to the white room; after the
# credits comes the face in the mirror.
seed 7
game witherlea
wait 5
cheat bot 2
botuntil caught == 1 6000
expect flag_F_EVER_CAUGHT == 1
botuntil scene == 7 60000
expect ending == 2
expect ending_best == 0
expect goals & 4
botuntil scene == 9 4000
botuntil scene == 1 1000
